Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:04.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gyms, a hundred and forty billion a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fitness trackers, fifty billion more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Billions poured into AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the smartest thing in this gym is still your thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mine's been doing it for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:23.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,Exercise, sets, reps, weight. All by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,Eventually I got tired of typing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:29.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,and started building my own solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:33.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&HCCE500&}IronPal{\r}. A headband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:37.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,It watches my set and fills in the log itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:41.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tiny camera. Motion sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:45.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,And my own model, running on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,No buttons. No pausing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:53.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,I lift, it logs the exercise, the reps and the weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:59.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Depth, back angle, knees. It checks all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,That used to need a trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:04.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Give your thumb a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:09.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Reserve your spot at {\c&HCCE500&}ironpal.co{\r}. It costs nothing today.
